  "note": "Urban district election, 20 May 1964; two wards, 15 seats (5 East, 10 West). West Ward was uncontested. Eight candidates for five seats; total votes polled 1,991, over 60 per cent of the electorate. Mr. Adair is described as a former Unionist member but carries no printed label beside his vote."
